      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton has just unveiled its Fall 2026 men's collection, drawing inspiration from the English countryside. The designer merges dandy elegance with functional sportswear, dressing the season's bags in autumnal shades of khaki green and tan, while small leather goods are adorned with motifs of the Scottish Highlands, pine-fringed beaches, and other natural scenery — bringing a pastoral charm to the men's wardrobe.",
