    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Anchored in a khaki green that captures the essence of autumn, the Monogram Surplus Jacquard collection uses jacquard weaving to create a three-dimensional Monogram pattern across cotton canvas. Deep brown leather trim and contrast stitching outline each piece, lending an effortless sophistication. The lineup spans the Speedy 30 and Speedy 18, Steamer 30, Jet Lag medium handbag, Christopher East West medium backpack, a belt bag, a wash bag, the Keepall 50 travel bag, and the Horizon 55 rolling suitcase — a versatile range equally at home on a country escape or in the city.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
