    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Monogram Archive canvas line introduces a new Jet Lag handbag, built on a roomy, practical messenger silhouette with a vintage leather strap buckle and brown leather trim. Its generous interior accommodates a laptop and other larger essentials, while the handle and detachable shoulder strap allow for hand-carry, shoulder, or crossbody wear — shifting effortlessly between styles. The Neverfull Cargo adds zipped and flap pockets to the exterior of the classic tote, infusing it with an outdoor, utilitarian edge.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
