      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Dandy Duffle 50 is crafted from Monogram Archive canvas in a spacious rectangular silhouette, with leather corners that lend a vintage refinement. The zipper opens fully to the base of the bag, making it easy to pack while laid flat. The Flaneur backpack comfortably fits a 14-inch laptop, with a magnetic flap for secure closure and a breathable mesh back panel for all-day carrying comfort.",
