    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Inspired by the pastoral landscapes of the Scottish Highlands, the Monogram Highlands small leather goods depict alpine meadows, pine groves by the shore, and other tranquil natural vistas on coated canvas, subtly interwoven with Monogram flowers and the LV emblem. Painterly brushstrokes bring the poetry of the English countryside to these refined accessories, adding a touch of delight to the everyday. The range includes wallets and passport covers, lined in blue or green cross-grain leather.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
