    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The mascot Louis Bear is dressed for a casual picnic, carrying a basket of fruit and sporting a blue suit, polka-dot tie, and round sunglasses — a playful, distinctive touch when clipped to a bag. The LV Racoon bag charm, crafted from leather and Monogram canvas, takes the form of an adorable raccoon, with silver studs as its wide-eyed gaze and a compartment inside for stashing earbuds and other small items.",
